  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Gender-based Violence Coordination and Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An assistance award to strengthen system-wide gender-based violence in emergencies coordination and response capacity. the two central tenets of the project are (1) strengthening gender-based violence coordination and response capacity at national and sub-national level and (2) increasing women-led organizations leadership and engagement in gender-based violence coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
